{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS3YEyQsxVWVikKEs2wW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Воспроизвёл две из трёх причин: `Duplicate scope` на шаге authorize (сообщение совпадает с заметкой коллеги) и отказ GET-ссылки без заголовка. Ниже проверю цепочку на токене и истечение через час. Теперь правлю код, начиная с конфига."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":865,"cache_read_input_tokens":40898,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":865},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1344e577-4446-40c6-a664-42bf20511b28","uuid":"3ff65c06-9795-4139-914e-2f71568aedff","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:38:03.893Z","request_id":"req_011CgS3YEinParKCMKv2EJQo"}
